  "body": "## 更新内容 / What's New（安卓 v0.1.17）\n\n这一版主要修了三处问题。\n\n编辑时段页面在小屏手机，或系统把显示调大时，图标行和星期行会超出屏幕。现在可以正常显示。\n\n完全锁定进行期间，输入解锁码也不能跳过、暂停或关闭该时段。这些被拒绝的操作不会扣除解锁次数。\n\n应用图标如果解码失败，会改用回退显示，避免出现空白或异常画面。\n\n已知限制：这一版还没有在小米真机上复测。小米、OPPO 等机型的后台冻结和自启动限制，仍需真机确认。部分手机打开受限应用时，仍可能短暂露脸。\n\niPhone 版没有更新，仍是目前已发布的 v0.1.5。\n\nThis release fixes three issues.\n\nOn small screens, or when the system display size is increased, the icon row and weekday row on the schedule editor could overflow. They now fit the screen.\n\nWhile Complete Lock is active, entering the unlock code still cannot skip, pause, or turn off that schedule. Those rejected attempts do not use up unlock quota.\n\nIf an app icon fails to decode, the app now falls back to a placeholder instead of showing a blank or broken image.\n\nKnown limits: this build has not been retested on a Xiaomi phone. Background freeze and autostart limits on Xiaomi, OPPO, and similar devices still need real-device checks. On some phones, a restricted app may still flash briefly when opened.\n\nThe iPhone app is unchanged and remains the currently published iOS version, v0.1.5.\n\nversionCode: 38\nsha256: 3e379ff666959beeabe555790dd3250351e13f9aeb376f9b501865c2295038d3\n",
